    "body": "<h2 id=\"01H8HK140ZAJ4VEGHX490GZ10F\">You will learn</h2>\n<p>Learn how to email a single recipient in Klaviyo. To learn how to send a message to a group of contacts all at once, head to <a href=\"https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/115005054847-Guide-to-Creating-and-Sending-an-Email-Campaign\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">guide to creating and sending an email campaign</a>.</p>\n<h2 id=\"h_01G65ZT3S7SR0JC0YYDDTZ0RQV\">Create a personal email</h2>\n<ol>\n<li>Locate a recipient’s profile by searching for their name or email address in the <em>Search</em> field at the top of your Klaviyo window.</li>\n<li>Click <strong>View messages</strong> in the top right corner of their profile. <br><img src=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/34638517655963\">\n</li>\n<li>Click <strong>Send email</strong> in the top right corner.<br><img src=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/34638517662747\" alt=\"Message center, showing the send email button\">\n</li>\n<li>Complete the message details (e.g., subject line and sender name/email address). </li>\n<li>Choose a message type (drag and drop, text only, or HTML).\n<ul>\n<li>Drag and drop is the most popular choice.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>Click <strong>Continue to email</strong>.</li>\n<li>Choose a template (if required) and add in your custom content.</li>\n<li>Click <strong>Exit</strong> when the message is ready.</li>\n<li>Click <strong>Schedule &amp; send email</strong>.</li>\n<li>Choose a date and time for the message to send (i.e., send now or schedule for a future time), then click <strong>Schedule email</strong>.</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"bs-callout bs-callout-default\">\n<p>Do not send personal messages to profiles that are suppressed from marketing emails, or to SMS-only profiles. To send a personal SMS in Klaviyo, <a href=\"https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/360059002271-Guide-to-SMS-Conversations-in-Klaviyo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">use SMS conversations</a>. </p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"wistia_responsive_padding\" style=\"padding: 52.19% 0 0 0; position: relative;\">\n<div class=\"wistia_responsive_wrapper\" style=\"height: 100%; left: 0; position: absolute; top: 0; width: 100%;\"><iframe class=\"wistia_embed\" title=\"Send personal message Video\" src=\"https://fast.wistia.net/embed/iframe/9sugaegv9n?videoFoam=true\" name=\"wistia_embed\" width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allow=\"autoplay; fullscreen\"></iframe></div>\n</div>\n<p>\n<script src=\"https://fast.wistia.net/assets/external/E-v1.js\" async=\"\"></script>\n</p>\n<p>If you're attempting to re-send a flow or campaign email:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<a href=\"https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/115000102752-Create-Edit-Delete-and-Manage-Templates#save-an-email-as-a-template\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Save the original email as a template</a>.</li>\n<li>Choose <strong>Drag and drop</strong> &gt; <strong>Email: saved</strong>. </li>\n<li>Click on the template you want.</li>\n<li>In the modal, select <strong>Use template</strong>. <br>\n<ul>\n<li>Please note that if you're using a flow template that contains dynamic event data (e.g., an abandoned cart block), this data can not populate in a personal email.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"bs-callout bp-callout-default\">\n<p>If you are using the <a href=\"https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/360004059711#h_01HFEZWHWN7AVGXQB8TGQT6BXG\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">feature to exclude bot clicks</a>, note that personal email reporting still includes and reflect bot clicks. Learn more about <a href=\"https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/22981852783899\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">bot clicks and how they are tracked in Klaviyo</a>.</p>\n</div>\n<p>If you have coupons with codes already generated in Klaviyo, you can include these in personal emails as well. </p>\n<h2 id=\"h_01G65ZSXNECG0764T6GX2HV1A9\">Cancel a scheduled personal message</h2>\n<p>You can only cancel a personal message if it hasn’t been sent yet. Personal messages sent using the <strong>Send Now</strong> button and messages with a scheduled send time in the past cannot be canceled. </p>\n<ol>\n<li>From a profile’s <strong>Messages</strong> tab, navigate to the <strong>Scheduled</strong> tab.\n<ul>\n<li>If your scheduled message does not appear in the <em>Scheduled </em>tab, it has already been sent and cannot be canceled. </li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>Hover over the personal message you’d like to cancel in the list of recent messages. <br><img src=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/34638502016667\" alt=\"Hovering over a scheduled personal message\">\n</li>\n<li>Click <strong>Delete</strong>.</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"01H8HK140ZGEQ2NXYHB76KG4F0\">Edit a scheduled personal message</h2>\n<p>To edit a scheduled message that has not yet been sent, first <a href=\"https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/115005253868\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">save the message as a template</a> (if desired), <a href=\"#h_01G65ZSXNECG0764T6GX2HV1A9\" target=\"_self\">cancel the message</a>, then <a href=\"#h_01G65ZT3S7SR0JC0YYDDTZ0RQV\" target=\"_self\">create a new personal message</a>. </p>\n<h2 id=\"01H8HK140ZE2BDX4QYN76ZTPH1\">Additional resources</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/115005247088\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Guide to profiles in Klaviyo</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/360037101072\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Understanding consent in profiles</a></li>\n</ul>",
    "user_segment_ids": []
  },
